        }
      },
      {
        "index": 82,
        "name": "Blue Light Special",
        "description": "MENU: “Let’s check out those giant crystals in the geometric caves next!”\nMENU: “There’s gotta be something cool in there.”\nMINA: “I don’t need to give you the lesson about $MUSU currents again do I?”\nMINA: “It should be obvious that just as I predicted, you’ll find another essence there.”\nMINA: “It seems you can’t touch that lantern though. No great worry.”\nMINA: “A bit strange, but no obstacle.” \nMINA: “As long as you and your Kami can scavenge, you’re gold.”",
        "repeatable": false,
