        "description": "MINA: “I believe that flower is more than just a pretty drawing.”\nMINA: “Have you heard of sigil magic?”\nMINA: “It’s quite old, but had a modern revival some decades past.”\nMINA: “You may have read about it in a comic book.”\nMINA: “To seal your magic in a single image. That’s what this is.”\nMINA: “Let your Kami out to harvest and search more thoroughly.”\nMIN
